      "english": "Thank You for the Umbrella"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小雨：",
      "traditional": "小雨：",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "前天下雨，谢谢你的雨伞！",
      "traditional": "前天下雨，謝謝你的雨傘！",
      "pinyin": "qián tiān xià yǔ xiè xie nǐ de yǔ sǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "今天你不在，我把你的雨伞放在门旁边了。",
      "traditional": "今天你不在，我把你的雨傘放在門旁邊了。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān nǐ bú zài wǒ bǎ nǐ de yǔ sǎn fàng zài mén páng biān le",
      "english": "Thank you for the umbrella when it rained the day before yesterday!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我买了水果，放在你的桌子上，谢谢你！",
      "traditional": "我買了水果，放在你的桌子上，謝謝你！",
      "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi le shuǐ guǒ fàng zài nǐ de zhuō zi shang xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": "You weren’t here today, so I put your umbrella next to the door."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I bought some fruit which I put on top of your desk. Thank you!"
    },
    {
